<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson plunges 16.5 Skr to 233 at open.</title>
<headline>Ericsson plunges 16.5 Skr to 233 at open.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish telecoms group Ericsson plummeted 16.5 crowns to 233 at the opening on Monday on the Stockholm Stock Exchange following losses in New York on Friday.</p>
</text>
